  "prompt": "The function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\nis a constant. If the graph of\n[Figure 4]\npasses through the point\n[Figure 5]\n, what is the value of\n[Figure 6]\n?",
